WEBVTT

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:11.200
A battle royal is taking place in four 
Action Fields within Maiami City!

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:18.230
In the Volcano Area, You Show School's 
Yuya Sakaki teamed up with LDS's Dennis!

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:23.020
They defeated the powerful team of Takeda 
and Umesugi from Ryozanpaku School!

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:29.000
In the Iceberg Area, You Show 
School's Yuzu Hiiragi received help

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.620
from Gongenzaka Dojo's Noboru Gongenzaka!

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:37.680
They won against LDS exchange 
students Halil and Olga!

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.570
In the Ancient Ruins Area,

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:47.130
LDS's Kurosaki defeated three members of 
Knight of Duels, a team from overseas!

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:50.540
Fierce battles are happening everywhere!

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:53.300
Let's interview the fans!

00:00:53.620 --> 00:01:01.060
Okay!  I'll interview people from 
the participants' duel schools.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:05.680
First is You Show School's principal Shuzo 
Hiiragi, who teaches entertainment dueling.

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:09.450
Your daughter Yuzu and Yuya 
Sakaki both have one win.

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:12.250
They're off to a good start.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.340
Thank you!

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.920
They'll win and-  Oops, 
the camera is over here!

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.590
Go, Yuya!

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:19.590
Yuzu, do your best!

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:22.230
Make me shiver with your 
entertainment dueling!

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:24.830
What does Yuya's mother have to say?

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:27.370
Yuya is okay, but...

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:32.270
I want to see more cuties 
like Dennis and Michy!

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.800
Yoko...

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:40.880
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:46.090
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:49.120
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:53.360
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:56.110
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:58.780
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:01.580
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:12.690
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:18.160
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:23.770
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.910
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.850
Repeating Up/Down

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:34.180
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:41.460
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:44.890
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:49.900
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:56.970
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:56.970 --> 00:03:07.480
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.180
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.890
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:15.680
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:18.430
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:27.920
Sora Shiunin Attacks!!

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:32.890
Friendship is important.

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:38.100
I learned that wonderful friendship 
decides the outcome of a match.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:42.280
That doesn't mean I have to team up with you.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:46.540
There are two Pendulum Cards here.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:51.780
As a sign of friendship, Olga 
and I will take one each.

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.650
What's going on?

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:58.250
It's like the cards are alive!

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:06.390
Here they are!

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:11.160
All right!

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:13.560
I caught some!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.840
I've hooked a couple of guests!

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.700
You're up, Michy!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.370
Leave it to me.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:26.820
Since you've come all the way from overseas, 
I'll give you my best hospitality.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.860
Duel me!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.680
It's Michy!

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:38.460
He's so cute and cool!

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:44.160
I've gathered these cards 
without having to duel.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.400
I still have plenty of bait.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:51.870
Teppei, if I team up with you, I can 
show hospitality by having many duels.

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:54.970
You're a partner I can count on!

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:59.340
This is what's going to happen:

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:04.310
Michy will gather many Pendulum 
Cards from his opponents.

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:08.170
When he gets tried, I'll challenge him.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:11.200
When I win, all his cards will be mine!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.590
I'll catch a huge haul!

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:16.560
Go, Michy!  I'm counting on you, partner!

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:20.840
Teppei Tairyobata isn't going to do anything.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:24.000
He's not going to duel and 
let Michy do everything?

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.800
What is he thinking?

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.130
You're fine by yourself?

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:31.370
I'm fine dueling both of you at once.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.010
In that case...

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:36.010
Now!

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.170
Duel!

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:45.910
It's a two-on-one duel in the Jungle 
Area!  Halil and Olga vs Michio Mokota!

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:53.700
Whoa!  Someone has arrived in the Volcano 
Area where Yuya Sakaki had a fierce battle!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.350
He's not here.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.510
If you're looking for Yuya, 
he went to a different area.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.410
Hey.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:05.140
Who are you?

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:10.400
I'm Dennis, LDS exchange 
student and Yuya's friend.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.280
Friend?

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.120
Yeah!

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.200
If you duel, everyone is a friend!

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:21.790
You dueled Yuya?

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:26.940
Our teamwork was so good that it's hard 
to believe it was the first time we met,

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.970
and we defeated Ryozanpaku School.

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:35.620
I want to duel you so that we can 
become friends, Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.610
You know who I am?

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:41.110
You're the daughter of You 
Show School's principal.

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:46.800
I want to become an entertainment 
duelist like Yusyo Sakaki.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.550
Is he hitting on my daughter?

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:53.020
After he's friends with Yuya...

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:55.640
He's putting the moves on Yuzu?

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.640
He's so smooth that he makes me shiver-

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.080
He's cute!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.460
Yoko!

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:03.330
Fine, let's duel.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:09.020
Since you want to become an entertainment 
duelist, I'm interested in seeing how you duel.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:17.350
We both have one win, so let's 
wager two Pendulum Cards.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:22.000
Good idea!  You're an entertainer!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.220
That will excite the crowd!

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:25.910
Duel!

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.040
Ladies first.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:32.170
No, I want to see what you can do.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.810
I'll let you go first.

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:35.540
What an honor.

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:37.860
Then it's my turn!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:43.140
When there are no monsters on our 
fields, I can Special Summon this card.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:46.710
I Special Summon Performage Stilts Launcher!

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:55.080
I set one card, and then I place 
the Scale 10 Pendulum Card

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:57.760
Yellow Scarab in the Pendulum Zone!

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:02.710
You only placed one card?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.310
Yellow Scarab's Pendulum effect activates!

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:10.840
A Spellcaster-Type monster 
gains 300 attack points!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.040
I see.  So you could use that effect.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:19.060
You need two cards to Pendulum Summon,

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.620
but it can be useful to activate it alone.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.280
I end my turn.

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:27.640
Since he played only one card,

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:31.020
that means he didn't have two 
Pendulum Cards in his hand.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.440
In that case...

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.540
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:44.350
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 3 
White Butterfly and Scale 9 White Flower!

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:50.940
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 4 and 8 simultaneously!

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:53.940
Pendulum Summon!  You're up!

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:59.550
Soprano the Melodious Songstress!

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:03.720
And Tamtam the Melodious Diva!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:14.630
I can use my Soprano to Fusion Summon 
without using Polymerization.

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:18.220
I fuse Soprano and Tamtam!

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:21.370
The angel's song!  The soul's reverberation!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:24.470
Follow the baton and stack your power!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.170
Fusion Summon!

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:30.650
Take the stage with the song of victory!

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:34.080
Bloom Diva the Melodious Choir!

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:40.700
Hiiragi successfully Pendulum Fusioned!

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:43.730
Such a beautiful series of moves!

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:47.420
Fantastic!  You're wonderful!

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:49.100
You Show School is impressive!

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.300
Hold the applause until I attack!

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:54.300
Oh, I apologize.

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:59.700
Since Tamtam the Melodious Diva was used 
to Fusion Summon, its effect activates!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:05.050
By lowering Bloom Diva's attack points 
by 500, you take 500 points of damage!

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:09.910
My god!

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:15.260
Let's battle!  Bloom Diva 
attacks Stilts Launcher!

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:20.120
Bloom Diva can't be destroyed in battle 
against a Special Summoned monster,

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:24.310
and the damage I take is negated!

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:29.950
And you take damage equal to the amount that 
was negated, and your monster is destroyed!

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:31.110
Reflect Shout!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:42.760
That's an unusual monster.

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:50.310
I'm annoyed, so I activate 
the Action Spell Flame Ball.

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:54.360
That isn't much damage!

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:59.950
Flame Ball will now burst 
into a colorful rainbow.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:03.340
One two three!

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:18.220
Are you okay?  Sorry to surprise you.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:22.440
By banishing Stilts Launcher 
from my graveyard,

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:28.200
Flame Ball's damage equals the most 
amount of damage I took from you.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:31.370
Dennis has damaged Hiiragi!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:35.370
Their furious back-and-forth 
is full of entertainment!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:40.130
You both get fired up!  
Get your blood boiling!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.150
Forget the other duel.  
Michy is doing big things!

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:44.480
It gives me shivers!

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:49.780
Whoa!  Something new is happening 
in the Ancient Ruins Area!

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:57.910
Kurosaki!

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:01.130
I have a lot of things to ask you.

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:04.570
About Sora.  About Academia!

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.930
I was also waiting for you.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.870
Where did you take Ute?

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:12.240
Ute?

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:13.740
Who's that?

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:17.770
I know that Ute battled against Sora Shiunin.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.680
And that you interfered.

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:24.170
Ute suddenly vanished afterwards.

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:27.660
What happened?  What did you do to Ute?

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:28.750
I...

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.630
I know you did something!

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:38.870
Or else, why would you have Ute's 
card Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon?

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:43.770
I also don't know what happened.

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:47.730
But Ute wants me to make 
people smile by dueling!

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:51.510
This card's effect allows 
it to attack you directly!

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:56.020
Slash the Assault Knight 
attacks you directly!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:05.990
Slash the Assault Knight can 
change battle damage to 0!

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:11.640
Knight of Duels?

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.830
They don't give up.

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.280
I end my turn.

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:18.220
These folks are talking nonsense.

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:20.840
Let's kick them out of our way!

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:25.280
My turn!  Slash the Assault 
Knight attacks you directly!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:34.320
Slash the Assault Knight 
changes the damage to 0!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:41.060
They're using this duel as 
an excuse to try to hurt me.

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.000
No way!

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:43.680
I end my turn.

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:47.720
We can continue this forever 
until they crumble to pieces.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:53.110
If they don't like it, they can join the 
duel by paying a penalty of 2000 life points.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:57.520
My turn!  Slash the Assault 
Knight attacks you directly!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:19.700
They're a disgrace as duelists!

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.440
We're simply dueling.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.670
We're not breaking any rules.

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:32.110
Kurosaki...

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.720
Who are they?

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:49.810
Who's that?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:53.200
Cut the Ancient Ruins feed from the public!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.340
Why did it disappear?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:06.840
Umm...  There's trouble 
with one of the feeds.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:12.130
Please watch the fierce battle 
in the Volcano Area instead.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:17.420
I activate the Continuous 
Spell Slow Tempo from my hand!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:25.060
Our monsters can't attack on the 
turn that they're Normal Summoned.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.820
I end my turn.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.540
I see.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:32.270
Special Summoned monsters 
can't destroy Bloom Diva.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:35.630
And if I try dealing with 
it using Normal Summons,

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:38.000
they can no longer immediately attack.

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:43.060
But this is what makes 
the show more exciting.

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:46.170
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:50.760
My showtime begins!

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:58.340
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 2 Blue Whale 
and Scale 10 Yellow Scarab that I placed earlier!

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:07.160
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 3 and 9 simultaneously!

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:09.240
Pendulum Summon!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.980
Come!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:15.800
Level 4 Performage Damage Juggler!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:21.020
And Level 4 Performage Flame Eater!

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:27.490
I overlay Level 4 Damage 
Juggler and Flame Eater!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.670
Show must go on!

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:38.580
Sky magician, travel around 
the stage magnificently!

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.770
Xyz Summon!  Appear!

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:46.970
Rank 4 Performage Trapeze Magician!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.550
Xyz Summon!

00:16:55.420 --> 00:17:00.060
That's Yuzu Hiiragi, the girl 
Reiji Akaba told me about.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.680
Who are they?

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:06.270
That's...

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.140
You're...

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:23.340
I've been looking forward to this moment 
to settle things, Syun Kurosaki!

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.490
Sora, you're okay!

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:32.090
Hold them back so that they 
won't interfere with me.

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:35.510
Hey!  Stop it, Sora!

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.620
Don't speak to us like that!

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:40.670
Who are you?

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:42.640
Obelisk Force.

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:45.870
Battle Royal Mode.  Joining.

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:52.480
Let's battle!

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:56.260
Trapeze Magician attacks Bloom Diva!

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:01.150
That's pointless!

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:03.260
Bloom Diva's effect activates!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.220
Reflect Shout!

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:07.620
I expected that.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.770
If you did, then why attack?

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:13.430
Because it's an entertainer!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:18.240
Due to Trapeze Magician's effect,

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:22.470
effect damage that's equal or less 
than its attack points are negated!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:27.610
But due to Bloom Diva's effect, 
Trapeze Magician will be destroyed!

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:31.680
Wrong!  It's time for this 
century's super illusion!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.360
One two three!

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:02.020
What?  What's happening?

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:04.450
I surprised you again.

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:08.930
I activated the trap card Trick Box.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:15.130
Trapeze Magician isn't destroyed, 
and by negating its effects,

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.160
I switch control of it with your Bloom Diva.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.630
No way!

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.470
Let's battle!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:25.140
Bloom Diva attacks Trapeze Magician!

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:32.150
Trapeze Magician, Bloom Diva's gentle 
singing will put you to sleep!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.730
Reflect Shout!

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:51.950
It's too soon for you to sleep forever!

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:57.500
Dennis, you'll also be...

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:59.150
It's fine.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:03.200
When the monster that Trick 
Box switched is destroyed,

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:06.480
it's Special Summoned to the 
original player's field.

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:14.570
Welcome home, Trapeze Magician.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:23.580
Dennis defeated Hiiragi with 
excellent entertainment dueling!

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:27.420
Hey Dennis!  Stop holding on to Yuzu!

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:29.370
It's a nice perk.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.440
Unfortunately, I lost.

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:38.180
Now we're friends.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:41.150
Let's keep winning and duel again later.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:43.520
You're not going to keep winning!

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:47.950
Because I'm defeating you now!

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:52.420
Are you twins?

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.440
She looks like me.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:57.160
Is she Ruri?

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:04.600
Sorry!  We're trying to fix it!

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:07.570
We also cut the Volcano Area feed.

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:11.040
You're up.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.520
As the most likely candidates 
to join the Lancers,

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:16.720
I want you to unleash all your strength.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:24.880
Sora!

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.280
Wait!

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.660
Stop fighting!

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:38.930
Standard Dimension duelists 
are nothing special.

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:55.420
That's against the rules!

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:57.240
No, it's not.

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:59.660
It's only natural that the loser disappears.

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:00.890
Stop it.

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.590
Stop it.

00:22:07.080 --> 00:22:10.260
Stop it!

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:35.730
As long as there's a smile

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:42.510
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:47.810
I always believe

00:22:47.980 --> 00:22:51.330
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:56.960
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:05.600
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:12.470
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:19.140
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:23.210
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:55.640
I won't forgive Fusion Dimension or Academia!

00:23:56.320 --> 00:23:59.380
Why did you come to this world?

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:03.800
I won't let you do whatever you like!

00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:05.780
Duel me!

00:24:07.580 --> 00:24:11.730
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Xiangke and Xiangsheng

00:24:12.040 --> 00:24:14.530
The fun is only getting started!
